    "detailed_description": "<strong>Synopsis</strong><br><br>The penguin was cruelly taken away from his native land, separated from his family, and locked up inside a dungeon...<br>Now he is trying to return to the ice floe to find his loved ones again...<br>However, he only knows how to move forward...<br>Let's see if you are smart enough to help him.<br><br><strong>Rules</strong><br><br>You have to place objects correctly to help the penguin safely reach the exit<br>There could be multiple correct solutions<br>A correct solution is always easy to verify but may be difficult to find, unless P is equal to NP<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Synopsis</strong><br><br>The penguin was cruelly taken away from his native land, separated from his family, and locked up inside a dungeon...<br>Now he is trying to return to the ice floe to find his loved ones again...<br>However, he only knows how to move forward...<br>Let's see if you are smart enough to help him.<br><br><strong>Rules</strong><br><br>You have to place objects correctly to help the penguin safely reach the exit<br>There could be multiple correct solutions<br>A correct solution is always easy to verify but may be difficult to find, unless P is equal to NP<br><br>",
